@startuml seq-checkin
title In-class check-in

actor Student
participant "Student page" as UI
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant RoomRoster as Roster
participant ScreenQrService as QR
participant "Local helper" as Helper
actor Lecturer

Student -> UI : pick name, confirm email
UI -> API : identify
API -> Roster : verify email HMAC
Roster --> API : session, no checkmark
API --> UI : session

Student -> UI : hold camera 2s\non live barcode
UI -> API : POST distinct frames
API -> QR : liveness, freshness,\nsingle-use, room bind
QR --> API : ok or qr_static / qr_short
API --> UI : barcode accepted

Student -> Helper : open /prove?c=...
Helper -> Helper : bound address\nand peer in range
Helper -> API : HMAC observe
Helper --> UI : redirect

UI -> API : finish
API --> Student : checkmark and welcome
API --> Lecturer : ✓ on roster
@enduml
